cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MAS-OS in your research, please cite the accompanying paper and this repository."
title: "MAS-OS: Collaborative Operating System of Multi-Agent Systems"
abstract: >-
  MAS-OS is a memory-centric collaborative operating system for LLM-based
  multi-agent systems. It unifies a Memory Manager, an Agent Scheduler, and a
  Context Allocator, and jointly optimizes scheduling and context allocation
  with reinforcement learning.
